[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0071","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14223","title":"Alfresco Community Edition Share 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Alfresco Community Edition 5.2.6 以下版本、6.0.N 及 6.1.N 系列版本中，Alfresco Share 应用存在开放重定向漏洞（CWE-601）。攻击者可通过构造特制的 POST 请求，操纵请求参数将受害者重定向至任意恶意网站（支持 http、https、ftp、smb 等协议），从而实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击恶意链接），CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14223"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-06T17:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:17:58Z","remediation":"升级 Alfresco Community Edition 至 5.2.6 及以上版本，或升级至 6.2.x 及更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层对 `/share/page/dologin` 的 `failure` 和 `success` 参数进行白名单校验，仅允许内部合法重定向目标 URL，阻止任意协议的外部跳转。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://community.alfresco.com/content?filterID=all~objecttype~thread%5Bquestions%5D","https://github.com/DrunkenShells/Disclosures/tree/master/CVE-2019-14223-Open%20Redirect%20in%20Alfresco%20Share-Alfresco%20Community","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14223.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14223.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/15bf95c7b4616c8551a2bd666d40a8a1a07282d6/2019/CVE-2019-14223.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14223.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-14223.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2019-14223-3835.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14223-3834.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14223-3836.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14223-3831.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14223-3833.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2019/14xxx/CVE-2019-14223.json","https://github.com/mbadanoiu/CVE-2019-14223"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0071.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0706","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15949","title":"Nagios XI 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Nagios XI 5.6.6 之前版本存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。攻击者需以 nagios 用户权限访问服务器，或通过 Web 界面以 admin 用户登录。系统通过下载系统配置文件（profile.php?cmd=download）调用 getprofile.sh 脚本，该脚本借助免密码 sudo 配置以 root 权限执行，并调用由 nagios 用户拥有的 check_plugin 可执行文件。拥有插件修改权限的 Nagios XI 用户或服务器上的 nagios 用户可修改 check_plugin 并植入恶意命令，从而以 root 权限执行任意命令，实现完全控制服务器。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15949"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-09-05T17:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:24Z","remediation":"立即将 Nagios XI 升级至 5.6.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 getprofile.sh 脚本通过无密码 sudo 以 root 权限执行 check_plugin 导致的命令注入问题。如无法立即升级，可采取以下临时缓解措施：(1) 编辑 /etc/sudoers 文件，移除 nagios 用户对 getprofile.sh 的无密码 sudo 权限（删除或注释相关条目）；(2) 将 check_plugin 文件所有者改为 root，并移除 nagios 用户的写入权限（chown root:root /path/to/check_plugin && chmod 755 /path/to/check_plugin）；(3) 在 Web 界面中严格限制普通用户修改插件的权限，仅授予管理员必要的插件管理权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156676/Nagios-XI-Authenticated-Remote-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162158/Nagios-XI-getprofile.sh-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://github.com/jakgibb/nagiosxi-root-rce-exploit","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-15949","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52138","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-15949.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-15949.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/52ab10bd804e22d7a1e3ce8d118700d9c56bd957/2019/CVE-2019-15949.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-15949.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-15949.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b51e2278437c32dc795d5eaa3888baba6465f89d/data/markdown/CVE-2019-15949-0xla1n_Nagios-CVE-2019-15949-RCE-Poc.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-15949.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-15949.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-15949.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-15949.md","https://github.com/hadrian3689/nagiosxi_5.6.6","https://github.com/plur1bu5/Nagios-CVE-2019-15949-RCE"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0706.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0706.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0078","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0078.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14470","title":"WordPress UserPro 插件 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"cosenary 开发的 Instagram-PHP-API（又称 Instagram PHP API V2）存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该库被 WordPress 的 UserPro 插件所集成，影响 UserPro 4.9.32 及以下版本。漏洞位于 example/success.php 页面的 error_description 参数处，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 payload，诱使管理员或用户访问包含该参数的 URL，在受害者浏览器中执行任意脚本，进而实现会话劫持、敏感信息窃取或网站内容篡改。该漏洞利用无需身份认证且攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 6.1。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14470"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-04T20:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:18:29Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress 站点上的 UserPro 插件到最新版本（当前 4.9.33 或更高版本），这修复了 example/success.php 中的 XSS 漏洞。通过 WordPress 控制面板 → 更新 → 可用更新中自动应用所有插件更新。如果无法立即更新，可临时通过编辑 wp-config.php 文件添加 `define('WP_LOSTPASS_HANDLER', 'disable');` 以禁用易受攻击的 API 功能作为缓解措施。同时，确保所有 WordPress 核心文件和主题都保持在最新版本，并禁用不需要的插件以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154206/WordPress-UserPro-4.9.32-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://github.com/cosenary/Instagram-PHP-API/commits/master","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9815","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47304","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14470.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14470.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14470.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-14470.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14470-3854.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14470-3855.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14470-3851.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-14470-3852.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-14470.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2019-14470.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-14470.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0078.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0096","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15889","title":"WordPress download-manager插件跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Download Manager 插件在 2.9.94 版本之前存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞（CWE-79）。该漏洞源于插件在 category 短代码（shortcode）功能中对 `orderby`、`search[publish_date]` 等参数的输入过滤与输出转义不充分，攻击者无需任何权限，即可将恶意构造的 JavaScript 载荷注入这些参数并生成恶意链接。当受害者点击该链接时，恶意脚本会在其浏览器会话中以当前用户权限执行，可导致会话 Cookie 窃取、账户接管、敏感信息泄露或页面内容篡改。攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低，但需诱导用户交互，CVSS 3.0 评分为 6.1，危害等级中危，影响 WordPress Download Manager 2.9.94 之前的所有版本，官方已在 2.9.94 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15889"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-03T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:16Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 Download Manager 插件升级至 2.9.94 或更高版本（该版本修复了 category 短代码功能中 orderby、search[publish_date] 等参数未正确转义导致的存储型 XSS 问题），可在 WordPress 后台「插件 → 已安装的插件」中点击更新，或从 https://wordpress.org/plugins/download-manager/ 下载覆盖更新。若暂时无法升级，作为临时缓解措施：停止在文章或页面的 category 短代码中渲染任何来自用户输入的可信度较低的参数，并安装启用 Web 应用防火墙（如 Wordfence）对含 orderby、search[publish_date] 等参数的请求进行过滤拦截；同时在后台限制贡献者/订阅者角色发布含该短代码内容的权限，降低被恶意利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154356/WordPress-Download-Manager-2.9.93-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152511/WordPress-Download-Manager-2.9.92-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152552/WordPress-Download-Manager-2.9.93-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/2070388/download-manager","https://wordpress.org/plugins/download-manager/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9257","https://www.cybersecurity-help.cz/vdb/SB2019041819","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47350","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15889.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15889.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15889.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-15889.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15889-3901.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15889-3902.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15889-3905.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15889-3904.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-15889.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2019-15889.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-15889.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0085","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15043","title":"Grafana HTTP API 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Grafana 2.x 至 6.x 版本（低于 6.3.4）的 HTTP API 存在访问控制缺陷，`/api/snapshots` 端点未要求身份验证即可使用。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该端点发送特制的 POST 请求，反复创建包含大量数据的快照，导致 Grafana 服务器磁盘空间被耗尽，从而触发拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 Grafana 2.x 至 6.x 全部版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用此缺陷，在服务器上执行未授权操作，影响仪表板创建、用户管理等依赖数据库的常规功能。Grafana 已在 6.3.4 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15043"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-03T12:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:19:35Z","remediation":"将 Grafana 升级至 6.3.4 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 grafana.ini 配置文件中设置 [auth.anonymous] enabled = false 以禁用匿名用户访问，或在反向代理层面对 /api/ 路径实施访问控制，仅允许授权 IP 访问 Grafana HTTP API，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2020-06/msg00060.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2020-07/msg00083.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2020-10/msg00009.html","https://community.grafana.com/t/grafana-5-4-5-and-6-3-4-security-update/20569","https://community.grafana.com/t/release-notes-v6-3-x/19202","https://github.com/grafana/grafana/releases","https://grafana.com/blog/2019/08/29/grafana-5.4.5-and-6.3.4-released-with-important-security-fix/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/RF5ARGYX3WYB7H2FDR7VAWTEQ27UX3FU/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/UO4NBL7PKW4OSFRVZENGC42EWEJV2YAH/","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20191004-0004/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15043.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15043.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2019/CVE-2019-15043.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15043.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-15043.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-15043-3868.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-15043-3873.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15043-3871.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15043-3872.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/medium/CVE-2019-15043.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-15043/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-15043.py","https://github.com/h0ffayyy/CVE-2019-15043"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0085.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0085.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0094","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15858","title":"WordPress Woody ad snippets 插件未认证选项导入漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Woody ad snippets 插件在 2.2.5 版本之前，其 admin/includes/class.import.snippet.php 文件中的选项导入功能未进行身份验证，导致未经身份验证的远程攻击者可以直接发送特制的导入请求，将包含跨站脚本（XSS）载荷的恶意选项写入网站配置。当具有管理员权限的用户访问包含这些恶意选项的页面时，存储的 XSS 代码被执行，攻击者可借此进一步提升权限或在服务器上执行任意代码，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本插件的 WordPress 站点，CVSS v3.1 评分为 8.8，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15858"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-03T07:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:13Z","remediation":"立即将 Woody ad snippets 插件升级到 2.2.5 或更高版本。由于该插件原作者已停止维护并因安全问题从 WordPress 官方仓库下架，建议直接卸载旧版 woody-ad-snippets / display-widgets 插件，改用由 Themeisle 接手的 Woody Code Snippets（insert-php）最新版本（当前 2.7.6）。升级前请先检查 WordPress 数据库中是否存在未经授权的 snippets 或管理员账户，并清理插件设置页中的导入配置，防止残留的 XSS 或远程代码执行入口被利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.nintechnet.com/multiple-vulnerabilities-in-wordpress-woody-ad-snippets-plugin-lead-to-remote-code-execution/","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9490","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15858.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15858.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2019/CVE-2019-15858.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15858.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-15858.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-15858-3888.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-15858-3894.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-15858-3891.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-15858-3892.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-15858-3890.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-15858-3893.yaml","https://github.com/GeneralEG/CVE-2019-15858","https://github.com/orangmuda/CVE-2019-15858"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0093","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15829","title":"WordPress photoblocks-grid-gallery 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 photoblocks-grid-gallery 插件在 1.1.33 之前的版本中存在存储型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击原理为插件在 wp-admin/admin.php?page=photoblocks-edit&id= 接口处未对用户输入进行充分过滤，导致具有较高权限的攻击者可在 id 参数中注入恶意 JavaScript 代码。当具有编辑权限的管理员或高权限用户访问包含恶意载荷的页面时，脚本会在其浏览器中执行，从而窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或发起进一步攻击。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本插件的 WordPress 网站，利用条件要求攻击者必须拥有较高权限账户才能触发漏洞，且需要目标管理员用户在 wp-admin 后台进行页面交互才能完成 XSS 利用。网站管理员应将 photoblocks-grid-gallery 插件升级至 1.1.33 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15829"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-30T14:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:09Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 插件 photoblocks-grid-gallery（Gallery PhotoBlocks）升级至 1.1.33 或更高版本（当前最新稳定版为 1.3.4）。操作步骤：登录 WordPress 管理后台，进入「插件」→「已安装的插件」，找到 Gallery PhotoBlocks，点击「立即更新」，或前往「插件」→「安装插件」搜索 PhotoBlocks 后点击更新。如更新后页面显示异常，可临时停用该插件，并在 .htaccess 中添加规则禁止外部用户访问含 photoblocks 的路径作为临时缓解，待插件完成修复后再重新启用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/photoblocks-grid-gallery/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9443","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15829.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15829.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15829.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-15829.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15829.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-15829.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-15829.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2019-15829.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-15829.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-15829.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15829.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0092","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15823","title":"WordPress wps-hide-login 插件保护绕过漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 wps-hide-login 插件在 1.5.3 之前版本中存在安全功能绕过漏洞。该插件用于隐藏 WordPress 默认登录页面 wp-login.php，以防范暴力破解和自动化攻击，但其在 /classes/plugins.php 文件中使用不安全的字符串匹配方式检查请求参数，仅通过 strpos 判断 URL 中是否包含 \"action=confirmaction\" 即放行访问。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在请求 URL 中拼接包含该字符串的查询参数（例如 wp-login.php?SECUPRESSaction=confirmaction），绕过插件的登录页面保护机制，直接访问 WordPress 默认登录页面，进而实施暴力破解、凭据填充或进一步入侵。该漏洞影响所有安装了 wps-hide-login 插件 1.5.3 之前版本的 WordPress 站点，攻击复杂度低，无需权限、无需用户交互，可远程利用，CVSS 评分为 9.8，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15823"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-30T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:08Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress 的 wps-hide-login 插件到 1.5.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 action=confirmaction 保护绕过漏洞。进入 WordPress 后台，点击「插件」→「已安装的插件」，找到 WPS Hide Login，如版本低于 1.5.3 则点击「更新」。若后台暂时无法访问插件页面，可登录 WordPress 管理后台的「插件」→「安装插件」，搜索 WPS Hide Login 进行覆盖安装。如因业务原因暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx 或 Apache）防火墙规则中拦截包含 action=confirmaction 参数的 wp-login.php 请求作为临时缓解措施，例如在 Nginx 配置中添加 return 403 规则阻断包含该参数的对 wp-login.php 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://secupress.me/blog/wps-hide-login-v1-5-2-2-multiples-vulnerabilities/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/wps-hide-login/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9469","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15823.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15823.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15823.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15823.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/wpserveur/wps-hide-login/CVE-2019-15823.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-15823.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2019-15823.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-15823.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-15823-wps_hide_login-db3724bf-35bb-4e28-b5e2-1bbc96adc7b6.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-15823.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-15823.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0508","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-13608","title":"Citrix StoreFront Server XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"Citrix StoreFront Server 存在 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞，由于服务器在处理 XML 输入时未正确限制外部实体的解析，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 XML 请求触发该漏洞，导致敏感文件读取或内部网络探测。该漏洞影响 Citrix StoreFront Server 1903 之前版本、7.15 LTSR CU4 之前版本及 7.6 LTSR CU8 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Citrix 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-13608"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-29T19:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:17:04Z","remediation":"升级 Citrix StoreFront Server 至 1903 版本，或 7.15 LTSR 升级至 CU4 (3.12.4000)，7.6 LTSR 升级至 CU8 (3.0.8000)。如无法立即升级，可在 StoreFront 服务器上配置 Web.config 禁用 DTD 解析，阻止 XML 外部实体注入攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX251988","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-13608","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13608.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-13608.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13608.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-13608.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2019-13608.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2019-13608.yaml","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13608.poc","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-13608.md","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/38832705dc969e0eda2621586fc4a7046a64de65/reports/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-13608.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2019/CVE-2019-13608.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/71536d4487506e17956a8631415b45ef3865b35d/2019/CVE-2019-13608.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0508.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0508.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0091","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15811","title":"DomainMOD cost-by-month.php 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"CVE-2019-15811是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15811"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-29T19:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:07Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 DomainMOD 至最新版本（4.13 之后版本已修复该 XSS 漏洞），并检查 `reporting/domains/cost-by-month.php` 文件中 `daterange` 参数的输出是否经过 `htmlspecialchars()` 或 `htmlentities()` 转义。如暂时无法升级，可在 Apache/Nginx 配置中添加 WAF 规则过滤 `daterange` 参数中的尖括号和 script 关键字，或在 php.ini 中启用 `default_charset = \"UTF-8\"` 并部署 ModSecurity 规则拦截 XSS 攻击载荷作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154270/DomainMod-4.13-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/108","https://zerodays.lol/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47325","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15811.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15811.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15811.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-15811.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-15811.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15811.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/domainmod/domainmod/CVE-2019-15811.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-15811.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-15811/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-15811.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-15811.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2019-15811.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0090","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15774","title":"WordPress nd-booking 插件开放重定向漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 nd-booking 插件 2.5 版本之前存在开放重定向漏洞。该插件在实现 AJAX 处理功能时暴露了一个无需身份验证的 nopriv_ 操作，未经认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 AJAX 请求修改 WordPress 站点的 siteurl 设置，将用户访问重定向至攻击者控制的恶意网站。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本插件的 WordPress 站点，攻击者利用此漏洞可发起钓鱼攻击或社工攻击，且需要用户点击链接才能触发重定向行为。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15774"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-29T12:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:02Z","remediation":"立即将 nd-booking（Hotel Booking）插件升级到 2.5 或更高版本，该版本已在 AJAX 请求中添加 nonce 验证机制，可阻断未认证的 nopriv_ AJAX 操作。升级路径：进入 WordPress 后台「插件」→「已安装的插件」→ 找到 nd-booking/Hotel Booking → 点击「立即更新」。升级后检查「设置」→「常规」中的 WordPress 地址（URL）和站点地址（URL）是否被篡改，如有异常请立即恢复。若无法立即升级，建议暂时停用该插件作为临时缓解措施，直至完成版本更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://threatpost.com/wordpress-plugins-exploited-in-ongoing-attack-researchers-warn/147671/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/nd-booking/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9494","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15774.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15774.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15774.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15774.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-15774.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2019-15774.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-15774-nd_booking-8b776a8a-b071-4caf-9e67-6f08ace4da2a.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-15774.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-15774.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-15774.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15774.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0041","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11248","title":"Kubernetes kubelet /debug/pprof 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Kubernetes Kubelet 组件的健康检查端口（healthz）未经身份认证即暴露了 /debug/pprof 调试端点。攻击者可通过该端点获取 Kubelet 内部内存地址、配置信息等敏感数据，或实施有限的拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 Kubernetes 1.15.0 之前、1.14.4 之前、1.13.8 之前及 1.12.10 之前的版本，默认配置下不暴露该端点，但若用户启用了 healthz 端口且未进行访问控制，则面临信息泄漏风险。CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11248"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-29T01:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:12:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Kubernetes 至 v1.15.0、v1.14.4、v1.13.8 或 v1.12.10 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 kubelet 启动参数中添加 `--profiling=false` 禁用性能分析端点，或在网络层面限制对 kubelet 健康检查端口（10250/10255）的访问，仅允许受信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/81023","https://groups.google.com/d/msg/kubernetes-security-announce/pKELclHIov8/BEDtRELACQAJ","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20190919-0003/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11248.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-11248.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11248.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-11248.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-11248-3734.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-11248-3732.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-11248-3728.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-11248-3731.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11248-3733.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-11248.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Google Kubernetes/CVE-2019-11248.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0686","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15752","title":"Docker Desktop Community Edition 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Docker Desktop Community Edition 2.1.0.1 之前版本存在不安全的权限分配漏洞（CWE-732）。低权限用户可将特制的恶意 docker-credential-wincred.exe 文件放置于 %PROGRAMDATA%\\DockerDesktop\\version-bin\\ 目录中，当管理员或服务用户执行 Docker 认证、重启 Docker 或运行 docker login 命令时，该恶意程序将被触发执行，导致权限提升。攻击者借此可获得与目标用户同等的系统权限，实现本地提权攻击。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15752"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-08-28T21:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:00Z","remediation":"升级 Docker Desktop Community Edition 至 2.1.0.1 或更高版本。同时限制 %PROGRAMDATA%\\DockerDesktop\\version-bin\\ 目录的写入权限，仅允许管理员账户修改该目录内容，防止低权限用户植入恶意文件。建议启用 Windows Defender 或第三方 EDR 对 docker-credential-wincred.exe 的异常加载行为进行监控。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157404/Docker-Credential-Wincred.exe-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf1bbc0ea4a9f014cf94df9a12a6477d24a27f52741dbc87f2fd52ff2%40%3Cissues.geode.apache.org%3E","https://medium.com/%40morgan.henry.roman/elevation-of-privilege-in-docker-for-windows-2fd8450b478e","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-15752","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48388","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-15752.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15752.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-15752.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-15752.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-15752.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/vex/cve/2019/CVE-2019-15752.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-15752.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-15752.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2019-15752","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-15752.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0089","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15713","title":"WordPress my-calendar 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress my-calendar 插件在 3.1.10 之前版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 脚本的特制 URL（如 rsd 参数），当用户点击该链接访问目标网站时，未经过滤的 URL 参数被直接回显到页面中，导致恶意脚本在受害者的浏览器中执行。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 my-calendar 插件的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 6.1。成功利用该漏洞可导致攻击者在站点上下文中执行任意脚本，进而窃取用户会话 Cookie、获取敏感信息或对网站进行篡改。my-calendar 插件维护者已在 3.1.10 版本中修复此问题，建议用户尽快升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15713"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-28T12:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:20:55Z","remediation":"将 WordPress 的 my-calendar 插件升级至 3.1.10 或更高版本以修复 XSS 漏洞。进入 WordPress 后台，导航至「插件」→「已安装插件」，找到 My Calendar 插件并点击「立即更新」。如后台更新失败，可手动下载 3.1.10 或更高版本安装包，通过「上传插件」方式覆盖安装。升级完成后清除站点缓存，并建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中配置针对 URL 参数的 XSS 过滤规则作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/my-calendar/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15713.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15713.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15713.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-15713.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15713-3887.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15713-3886.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-15713-3884.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-15713.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2019-15713.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15713.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2019-15713.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0089.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0087","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0087.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15642","title":"Webmin rpc.cgi 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Webmin 1.920 及之前版本中的 rpc.cgi 脚本存在远程代码执行漏洞。由于 unserialise_variable 函数在处理用户提交的对象名时未做充分过滤，直接调用 eval 执行恶意代码，导致已通过身份认证的远程攻击者可构造特制对象名称触发代码执行，从而完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响所有启用 RPC 功能的 Webmin 实例，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级为高。Webmin 官方已发布安全修复，建议用户立即升级至最新版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15642"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-26T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:20:47Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Webmin 到 1.921 或更高版本（修复提交 df8a43fb4bdc9c858874f72773bcba597ae9432c）。临时缓解：限制 RPC 接口访问权限，仅允许受信任管理员 IP 访问 /rpc.cgi，或在 Webmin 访问控制中禁用 RPC 模块功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://doxfer.webmin.com/Webmin/Webmin_Servers_Index","https://github.com/webmin/webmin/blob/ab5e00e41ea1ecc1e24b8f8693f3495a0abb1aed/rpc.cgi#L26-L37","https://github.com/webmin/webmin/commit/df8a43fb4bdc9c858874f72773bcba597ae9432c","https://www.calypt.com/blog/index.php/authenticated-rce-on-webmin/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15642.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15642.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/aaba13955b6f4608c4d9d9901b41c86a0a514345/2019/CVE-2019-15642.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2019/CVE-2019-15642.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15642.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-15642.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Webmin rpc.cgi 后台远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-15642.md","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/webapp/Webmin/Webmin rpc.cgi 后台远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2019-15642.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/webapp/Webmin-rpc.cgi-后台远程命令执行漏洞-CVE-2019-15642.md","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-15642.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/webmin/webmin/CVE-2019-15642.yaml","https://github.com/CLincat/vulcat","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2019-15642"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0087.toml"}]